-setting-premise-007"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop"},{"question":"The series is a single season of 52 episodes, which the show calls sessions.","correct":false,"kind":"episode","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["cowboy-bebop-episode-count-004"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop"},{"question":"In 2071 a crew of bounty hunters chase criminals around the Solar System from a ship called the Bebop.","correct":true,"kind":"lore","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["cowboy-bebop-setting-premise-007"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop"},{"question":"Yoko Kanno scored the show in a jazz-heavy style and formed the band Seatbelts to play it.","correct":true,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["cowboy-bebop-composer-seatbelts-008"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop"},{"question":"Satellite channel Wowow aired the show first, from 3 April to 26 June 1998, before the full run reached TV Tokyo.","correct":false,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["cowboy-bebop-tv-tokyo-run-005","cowboy-bebop-wowow-run-006"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'published', 10, 'anime', 0, null) on conflict (slug) do update set creator_id = excluded.creator_id, group_id = excluded.group_id, title = excluded.title, quiz_type = excluded.quiz_type, questions = excluded.questions, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, status = excluded.status, question_count = excluded.question_count, site_id = excluded.site_id, spoiler_arc_ord = excluded.spoiler_arc_ord, spoiler_scope = excluded.spoiler_scope where quizzes.site_id = 'anime';
