oser"},{"label":"Lucky Ending"},{"label":"Home"},{"label":"ad meliora"}],"correct":2,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":2,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-openings-s1-024","fruits-basket-openings-s2-025"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)"},{"question":"Three of these artists sang an opening of the 2019 anime. Which one sang an ending?","options":[{"label":"Monkey Majik"},{"label":"Ai Otsuka"},{"label":"Beverly"},{"label":"AmPm ft Miyuna"}],"correct":0,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":2,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-openings-s1-024","fruits-basket-openings-s2-025"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)"},{"question":"Three of these voice actors play cursed members of the family. Which one plays a character who is not cursed?","options":[{"label":"Makoto Furukawa"},{"label":"Megumi Han"},{"label":"Atsumi Tanezaki"},{"label":"Nobunaga Shimazaki"}],"correct":2,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-arisa-uotani-voice-070","fruits-basket-yuki-sohma-voice-034","fruits-basket-hatsuharu-sohma-voice-054","fruits-basket-momiji-sohma-voice-057"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters"},{"question":"Three of these people belong to the Honda family. Which one does not?","options":[{"label":"Kyoko Honda"},{"label":"Yuki Sohma"},{"label":"Katsuya Honda"},{"label":"Tohru Honda"}],"correct":1,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-yuki-sohma-name-033","fruits-basket-tohru-honda-name-030","fruits-basket-kyoko-honda-name-073","fruits-basket-katsuya-honda-name-074"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters"},{"question":"Three of these characters live in Shigure''s house. Which one does not?","options":[{"label":"Hatori Sohma"},{"label":"Tohru Honda"},{"label":"Yuki Sohma"},{"label":"Kyo Sohma"}],"correct":0,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-shigure-sohma-name-040","fruits-basket-tohru-honda-name-030","fruits-basket-hatori-sohma-name-050"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters"},{"question":"Three of these people worked on the 2019 anime. Which one directed the 2001 anime?","options":[{"label":"Yoshihide Ibata"},{"label":"Masaru Yokoyama"},{"label":"Taku Kishimoto"},{"label":"Akitaro Daichi"}],"correct":3,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-studio-2001-011","fruits-basket-director-016","fruits-basket-composer-018","fruits-basket-staff-017"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2001_TV_series)"},{"question":"Three of these zodiac members are cursed by animals that sit inside the zodiac. Which character is cursed by one that sits outside it?","options":[{"label":"Kyo Sohma"},{"label":"Hatsuharu Sohma"},{"label":"Kisa Sohma"},{"label":"Kagura Sohma"}],"correct":0,"kind":"lore","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-kyo-sohma-name-035","fruits-basket-kagura-sohma-name-058","fruits-basket-kisa-sohma-name-060","fruits-basket-hatsuharu-sohma-name-053"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'published', 10, 'anime', 2, 'both') on conflict (slug) do update set creator_id = excluded.creator_id, group_id = excluded.group_id, title = excluded.title, quiz_type = excluded.quiz_type, questions = excluded.questions, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, status = excluded.status, question_count = excluded.question_count, site_id = excluded.site_id, spoiler_arc_ord = excluded.spoiler_arc_ord, spoiler_scope = excluded.spoiler_scope where quizzes.site_id = 'anime';
insert into public.quizzes (creator_id, group_id, title, slug, quiz_type, questions, difficulty, status, question_count, site_id, spoiler_arc_ord, spoiler_scope) values ((select id from public.profiles where username = 'otakuquiz_team'), (select id from public.groups where slug = 'fruits-basket' and site_id = 'anime'), 'Fruits Basket Quiz: Zodiac Curses, a Rice Ball and Two Anime', 'zodiac-curses-a-rice-ball-and-two-anime-fruits-basket-quiz', 'multiple_choice', '[{"question":"Which shojo magazine carried the Fruits Basket manga?","options":["Ribon","Hana to Yume","Margaret","Nakayoshi"],"correct":1,"kind":"manga","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"manga"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-magazine-003"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket"},{"question":"Who both wrote and drew the manga?","options":["Natsuki Takaya","Naoko Takeuchi","Yuu Watase","Arina Tanemura"],"correct":0,"kind":"manga","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"manga"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-creator-002"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket"},{"question":"The title comes from a children''s game. Which one?","options":["Musical chairs","Duck duck goose","Hide and seek","Fruit Basket Turnover"],"correct":3,"kind":"lore","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-title-game-010"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket"},{"question":"In that game, what role does Tohru get instead of a fruit?","options":["A mochi","An onigiri","An umeboshi","A bento box"],"correct":1,"kind":"lore","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-title-game-010"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket"},{"question":"Over its whole run the manga produced how many chapters?","options":["150","136","108","120"],"correct":1,"kind":"manga","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"manga"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-chapters-007"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket"},{"question":"Which studio animated the 2019 remake?","options":["Studio Deen","Bones","TMS Entertainment","Madhouse"],"correct":2,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-anime-studio-015"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)"},{"question":"Who directed the first anime, broadcast in 2001?","options":["Yoshihide Ibata","Akitaro Daichi","Mamoru Hosoda","Shinichiro Watanabe"],"correct":1,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-studio-2001-011"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2001_TV_series)"},{"question":"How many TV seasons does the 2019 remake have?","options":["3","4","5","2"],"correct":0,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-total-episodes-022","fruits-basket-seasons-count-077"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket_(2019_TV_series)"},{"question":"Who composed the music of the 2019 anime?","options":["Yoko Kanno","Hiroyuki Sawano","Kenji Kawai","Masaru Yokoyama"],"correct":3,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-composer-018"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fruits_Basket"},{"question":"Which voice actress plays Tohru in the 2019 anime?","options":["Reina Ueda","Megumi Han","Manaka Iwami","Rie Kugimiya"],"correct":2,"kind":"character","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["fruits-basket-tohru-honda-voice-032"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Fruits_Basket_characters"}]'::jsonb, 'easy', 'published', 10, 'anime', 0, null) on conflict (slug) do update set creator_id = excluded.creator_id, group_id = excluded.group_id, title = excluded.title, quiz_type = excluded.quiz_type, questions = excluded.questions, difficulty = excluded.difficulty, status = excluded.status, question_count = excluded.question_count, site_id = excluded.site_id, spoiler_arc_ord = excluded.spoiler_arc_ord, spoiler_scope = excluded.spoiler_scope where quizzes.site_id