e two animated films","The Fuji TV anime","The Madhouse anime","The end of the manga''s longest hiatus"],"correct":3,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["hunter-x-hunter-longest-hiatus-006","hunter-x-hunter-first-anime-1999-007","hunter-x-hunter-second-anime-2011-008","hunter-x-hunter-two-films-2013-016"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter"},{"question":"Counting from 2013, which of these Hunter x Hunter events came first?","options":["The end of the manga''s longest hiatus","Phantom Rouge","The Last Mission","The Madhouse anime finale"],"correct":1,"kind":"production","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["hunter-x-hunter-film-order-042","hunter-x-hunter-two-films-2013-016","hunter-x-hunter-second-anime-2011-008","hunter-x-hunter-longest-hiatus-006"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter"},{"question":"Which of the 2011 anime ending songs plays first?","options":["Reason","Hyōri Ittai","Hunting for Your Dream","Nagareboshi Kirari"],"correct":2,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["hunter-x-hunter-ending-themes-015"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_(2011_TV_series)"},{"question":"Which of the 2011 anime ending songs plays last?","options":["Reason","Just Awake","Nagareboshi Kirari","Hyōri Ittai"],"correct":3,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["hunter-x-hunter-ending-themes-015"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_%C3%97_Hunter_(2011_TV_series)"},{"question":"Which of these arcs comes first in the story?","options":["Greed Island","Yorknew City","Election","Chimera Ant"],"correct":1,"kind":"arc","spoiler":{"arc":6,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["hunter-x-hunter-yorknew-reunion-045","hunter-x-hunter-greed-island-game-047","hunter-x-hunter-ant-queen-kite-048","hunter-x-hunter-election-zodiacs-050"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunter_×_Hunter"},{"question":"Which of