emes-s2-043","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-themes-s3-044"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_season_1"},{"question":"Three of these songs close a season of the anime. Which one opens a season?","options":[{"label":"Heart wa Oteage"},{"label":"Kaze ni Fukarete"},{"label":"Sentimental Crisis"},{"label":"GIRI GIRI"}],"correct":3,"kind":"music","spoiler":{"arc":3,"scope":"anime"},"fact_ids":["kaguya-sama-love-is-war-themes-s1-042","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-themes-s2-043","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-themes-s3-044"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_season_1"},{"question":"Three of these are spin-offs of the series. Which one is a separate series by Akasaka?","options":[{"label":"The Dōjin Edition"},{"label":"Kaguya-sama o Kataritai"},{"label":"Oshi no Ko"},{"label":"The Seven Mysteries of Shuchiin Academy"}],"correct":2,"kind":"odd_one_out","spoiler":{"arc":0,"scope":"manga"},"fact_ids":["kaguya-sama-love-is-war-oshi-no-ko-016","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-spinoff-doujin-024","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-spinoff-kataritai-025","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-novels-026"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War"},{"question":"Three of these are sisters or brothers of main characters. Which one is not?","options":[{"label":"Karen Kino"},{"label":"Kei Shirogane"},{"label":"Mikado Shijo"},{"label":"Moeha Fujiwara"}],"correct":0,"kind":"odd_one_out","spoiler":{"arc":4,"scope":"both"},"fact_ids":["kaguya-sama-love-is-war-karen-kino-name-079","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-kei-shirogane-name-071","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-moeha-fujiwara-name-073","kaguya-sama-love-is-war-mikado-shijo-name-085"],"source_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaguya-sama:_Love_Is_War_characters"},{"question":"Three of these belong to the Shinomiya family. Which one does not?","options":[{"label":"Un''yo Shinomiya"},{"label":"Oko Shinomiya"},{"label":"Mikado Shijo"},{"label":"Gan''an Shinomiya"}],"correct":2,"kind":"odd_one_o